      "notes": [
        "Dedicated native md-table family (one table model: grid tracks, column template, row groups, sticky / frozen header, pinning, selection, expansion, FLIP motion). Sort label with direction arrow motion, hover / focus states and the sortedAscending / Descending announcements; inside a table it drives the table sort, alone it emits mdSortRequest.",
